# ReactAdmin Overlays & Forms

shadcn/Radix UI. Lessons from hub (Add Contact / TopBar) and Acensure — patterns live in Veyra code.

## Overlay roles

| Pattern | Use for |
| :--- | :--- |
| **Sheet** (right) | Short create/edit. Header + scroll body + footer |
| **Dialog** | Form / detail modals (non-blocking confirm style) |
| **AlertDialog** | Destructive / blocking confirm (`ConfirmDialog` uses this) |
| **Sonner** (`ShowToast`) | Success/error flash after actions — [docs](https://sonner.emilkowal.ski/getting-started) |
| **Full page** | Multi-step wizards (order booking) |
| **DropdownMenu** | Profile / account menu from avatar |

## Toasts

```tsx
import { ShowToast } from '#/lib/toast'

ShowToast.success('Shipment created', { description: id })
ShowToast.error('Could not save')
```

Mount `<Toaster />` once in root (`__root.tsx`). Call toasts from handlers, not `useEffect`.

## Profile menu

```tsx
<DropdownMenu>
  <DropdownMenuTrigger asChild>{/* avatar */}</DropdownMenuTrigger>
  <DropdownMenuContent align="end" className="w-56">
    <DropdownMenuLabel>…name + email…</DropdownMenuLabel>
    <DropdownMenuItem>My profile → Sheet</DropdownMenuItem>
    <DropdownMenuItem>Settings</DropdownMenuItem>
    <DropdownMenuItem variant="destructive">Sign out</DropdownMenuItem>
  </DropdownMenuContent>
</DropdownMenu>
```

## Button roles (follow primary colour)

Primary token may change per tenant/brand; **roles stay fixed**:

| Role | Meaning | `Button` variant |
| :--- | :--- | :--- |
| Positive / success | Submit, Create, Save, Confirm (happy path) | `default` (or `marine` alias) — **bg primary** |
| Cancel / do nothing | Dismiss without saving | `secondary` — **muted grey** |
| Secondary action | Alternate path (e.g. “Create and add another”) | `outline` — **primary border + primary text** |
| Destructive | Delete / irreversible harm | `destructive` |

```tsx
<Button variant="secondary">Cancel</Button>
<Button variant="outline">Create and add another</Button>
<Button variant="default">Create shipment</Button>
```

Do not use outline for Cancel, or grey fill for the primary submit.

## Forms

- Layout: `Field` + `FieldLabel` + `Input`/`Select` + `FieldError`
- Controls ~`h-11`, dense labels
- Controlled Sheet: `open` / `onOpenChange`
- Prefer **react-hook-form + Zod** for real API forms; demo sheets may use local state
- Keep wrappers small under `components/ui` + `components/shared` — no Acensure `dev/core` god-file

### Required labels (red asterisk)

CSS in `styles.css`:

```css
label.required:after {
  content: '*';
  margin-left: 0.2rem;
  color: var(--destructive);
}
```

Usage:

```tsx
<FieldLabel htmlFor="ship-customer" required>
  Customer
</FieldLabel>
{/* or */}
<label className="required">Email</label>
```

Do not type `*` in the label text — use the `required` class / `FieldLabel required` prop.

